# U35: the range line dropdown (`main.showAllItemAffixes` off): a unique's range lines from
# UpdateDisplayItemRangeLines (the entries with a range or a mutation, selIndex 1, the slider's
# value from rangeLineList[1].range); pick another line (the dropdown's selFunc reads
# rangeLineList[index]). The range slider itself is not moved: clicking or dragging it diverges
# (knob x 1163.000032 vs 1163.0) in U33's DIVERGENCE(range-slider-val) emulation, not in this
# unit's code; see CCR-0124 §5.
#! u35-settings showAllItemAffixes="true" => showAllItemAffixes="false"
#! u35-expect display: Abyssus
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 800 544
click LEFTBUTTON
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 4
move 1150 600
frames 2
move 970 216
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 970 266
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 1150 600
frames 2
